# Route: guide 30 of 51 of the simulator's completionist route for Gnome (1451
# of 1458 eligible quests, 164.1 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 47 to 49, 30
# quests, 3.9 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Searing Gorge, Badlands, Loch Modan): The Cauldron -> Firewatch Ridge
# -> The Cauldron -> Firewatch Ridge -> The Cauldron -> Firewatch Ridge -> The
# Cauldron -> Grimesilt Dig Site -> Dustfire Valley -> Firewatch Ridge -> The
# Cauldron -> Firewatch Ridge -> The Cauldron -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): The Flame's Casing (3452; Twilight
# Dark Shaman 47-48, Twilight Fire Guard 48-49, Twilight Geomancer 49-50,
# Twilight Idolater 49-51); Prayer to Elune (3378; Twilight Dark Shaman 47-48,
# Twilight Fire Guard 48-49, Twilight Geomancer 49-50, Twilight Idolater
# 49-51); The Horn of the Beast (3181; Margol the Rager 48); WANTED: Overseer
# Maltorius (7701; Overseer Maltorius 50); Summoning the Princess (656;
# Myzrael 44); Tremors of the Earth (717; Blacklash 50, Hematus 50).
#
# Profession quests here are not routed (they need the skill): 3379
# Shadoweaver; 3385 The Undermarket; 3402 The Undermarket; 5144 Elemental
# Leatherworking.
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): A Crumpled Up Note (4264), Blackhand's Command (7761), The
# Left Piece of Lord Valthalak's Amulet (8966), The Left Piece of Lord
# Valthalak's Amulet (8967), The Left Piece of Lord Valthalak's Amulet (8968),
# The Left Piece of Lord Valthalak's Amulet (8969), The Right Piece of Lord
# Valthalak's Amulet (8989), The Right Piece of Lord Valthalak's Amulet
# (8990), The Right Piece of Lord Valthalak's Amulet (8991), The Right Piece
# of Lord Valthalak's Amulet (8992), Mea Culpa, Lord Valthalak (8995), Ribbly
# Screwspigot (4136), Kibler's Exotic Pets (4729), En-Ay-Es-Tee-Why (4862).

